# pm/ state discipline
- `pm/pm-state.json` is shared; claim a story there before working it and release it when done.
- Write only your own `pm/actors/<your-id>.json` and `<your-id>.HANDOFF.md`; never another actor's.
- `pm/log.md` is append-only, one actor-prefixed line per event; never rewrite history.
- Never write secrets into `pm/`; reference their location instead.
